seg-a4bdf55d96be = By the end you will have run a clock holdover with GNSS (Global Navigation Satellite System) signals denied, read the timing figure of merit, and understood the √(q_wf·T) drift law that explains <em>why</em> the optical clock outlasts the chip-scale one, with the law sourced from NIST (the US National Institute of Standards and Technology), not invented.

